<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Linux - 标签 - 运维个人技术栈</title><link>https://kentxxq.com/tags/linux/</link><description>Linux - 标签 - 运维个人技术栈</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 12 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://kentxxq.com/tags/linux/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>debian</title><link>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/debian/</link><pubDate>Sun, 12 May 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author><name>kentxxq</name></author><guid>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/debian/</guid><description><![CDATA[<p><code>debian</code> 是一个非常流行的 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/linux/">linux</a> 发行版.</p>
<p>特点:</p>
<ul>
<li>用户量很大. 特别是 docker 镜像基本都用 debian</li>
<li><a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/ubuntu/">ubuntu</a> 的源分支</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="资源" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e8%b5%84%e6%ba%90" class="header-mark"></a>资源</h2><ul>
<li>各架构的下载地址 <a href="https://cdimage.debian.org/debian-cd/current/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Index of /debian-cd/current</a>
<ul>
<li>cd-iso 版本通常需要网络</li>
<li>dvd-iso 版本通常镜像文件很大</li>
<li>其他不常用</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>]]></description></item><item><title>Systemd教程</title><link>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/systemd%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/</link><pubDate>Sat, 29 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author><name>kentxxq</name></author><guid>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/systemd%E6%95%99%E7%A8%8B/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h2 id="简介" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" class="header-mark"></a>简介</h2><p><a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/Systemd/">systemd</a> 的相关概念, 使用, 操作示例.</p>
<h2 id="服务-unit" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e6%9c%8d%e5%8a%a1-unit" class="header-mark"></a>服务 Unit</h2><h3 id="配置文件目录" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e9%85%8d%e7%bd%ae%e6%96%87%e4%bb%b6%e7%9b%ae%e5%bd%95" class="header-mark"></a>配置文件目录</h3><ol>
<li>系统配置文件目录 <code>/etc/systemd/system/</code> 的优先级最高, <strong>建议放在这</strong>.</li>
<li>其次为 <code>/usr/lib/systemd/system/</code>. 例如我用 apt 安装 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/nginx/">nginx</a> 后, 它的配置就放在这里.</li>
<li><code>/usr/lib/systemd/user/</code> 存放用户的配置, <strong>但是一般不用!!! 因为必须 user session 处于活动状态</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>可以参考 <a href="https://unix.stackexchange.com/questions/224992/where-do-i-put-my-systemd-unit-file" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Where do I put my systemd unit file?</a> , 以及文档 <a href="https://www.freedesktop.org/software/systemd/man/systemd.unit.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">systemd.unit-freedesktop</a>, <a href="https://man.archlinux.org/man/systemd.unit.5" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">systemd.unit(5)-arch</a></p>]]></description></item><item><title>linux初始化</title><link>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/linux%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96/</link><pubDate>Sat, 08 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author><name>kentxxq</name></author><guid>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/linux%E5%88%9D%E5%A7%8B%E5%8C%96/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h2 id="简介" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" class="header-mark"></a>简介</h2><p>经常会购买/重装 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/linux/">linux</a> 服务器, 制作过很多次的镜像. 这里记录一下的初始化配置, 以后搞成一个 shell 脚本来用.</p>
<h2 id="待添加" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e5%be%85%e6%b7%bb%e5%8a%a0" class="header-mark"></a>待添加</h2><p>#todo/笔记</p>
<ul>
<li>Alias</li>
<li>Truncate 定时清空日志</li>
<li>Limit 配置</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="server-初始化" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#server-%e5%88%9d%e5%a7%8b%e5%8c%96" class="header-mark"></a>server 初始化</h2><h3 id="限制登录" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e9%99%90%e5%88%b6%e7%99%bb%e5%bd%95" class="header-mark"></a>限制登录</h3><ol>
<li><a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/linux%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E4%B8%8E%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/#%E5%85%81%E8%AE%B8%20root%20%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95">允许 root 远程登录</a></li>
<li>允许 root 远程登录后，开始用 tabby 连接操作</li>
<li><a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/linux%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E4%B8%8E%E9%85%8D%E7%BD%AE/#%E7%A6%81%E7%94%A8%E5%AF%86%E7%A0%81%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95/%E5%AF%86%E9%92%A5%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95">禁用密码登录/密钥登录</a></li>
</ol>
<h3 id="执行-shell" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e6%89%a7%e8%a1%8c-shell" class="header-mark"></a>执行 shell</h3><p>开始运行</p>]]></description></item><item><title>linux内核参数调整</title><link>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/linux%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E8%B0%83%E6%95%B4/</link><pubDate>Sat, 01 Jul 2023 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author><name>kentxxq</name></author><guid>https://kentxxq.com/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/linux%E5%86%85%E6%A0%B8%E5%8F%82%E6%95%B0%E8%B0%83%E6%95%B4/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h2 id="简介" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e7%ae%80%e4%bb%8b" class="header-mark"></a>简介</h2><p>这里记录我调整过的 <a href="/posts/%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/point/linux/">linux</a> 内核参数.</p>
<h2 id="内核参数调整" class="headerLink">
